        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo àvabaliki vana vake",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Yakobo nkuvachema vana vake nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Idang'ana apano ninnyaulilange mambo lambenkojanga mmaduva laîda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anelo njo matawa kumi na mbili la Isilaeli. Na anelo njo malove lanatangwele atatawao pachim'baliki kila mwana kupapatana na namuna chachilembelewa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuhwa kwanga Yakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Isilaeli nkuvalaija vana vake wachidoni, “Nangu ngùvele pepi na kuhwa na kuhwena unaikala na anyakala vangu vahidîle kala. Nikàhwa, ngusike pachinu pavasikwije anakuluvangu, nnipanga livêle mmwelu mwa Efuloni Mhiti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aneko ku Makipela, pepi na ku Mamle, nchilambo cha ku Kanaani. Iblahimu ásumile lipanga na welu anewo kuhaloka kwa Efuloni, Mhiti, uchinga pààve pachinu pake pakusikila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aneko njo kwasikwije Iblahimu na Sala n'jawe, na njo kwasikwije Isaka na Labeka n'jawe, na njo kuninsikile Leya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welu anewo pamo na lipanga livêle mmwelu anewo, vísumwije kwa Vahiti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo pamalidile kuveng'a vana vake malaijo, nkuuiha madodo lake nchinanda, nkuhila. Nkuhwena unaikala pamo na anyakala vake vahidîle kala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
